WEBVTT

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:07.882
Everything's white!

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:11.636
This is amazing.

00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:12.637
Jeez!

00:00:12.637 --> 00:00:15.056
Don't just watch. Help me.

00:00:15.056 --> 00:00:16.141
Where's sis?

00:00:17.225 --> 00:00:18.935
I'm sure she's still asleep.

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.312
She went to bed early again last night.

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:24.899
She said she wanted to get
plenty of rest, so she'd be strong.

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:28.737
That doesn't sound like her.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.115
It's so cold.

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:37.996
Five more minutes...

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:39.372
Sis!

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:42.459
You were trying to go back
to sleep, weren't you?

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:45.295
- No!
- Liar! I just know it!

00:00:48.506 --> 00:00:51.426
The final preliminaries are today!

00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:54.220
Yeah!

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:55.805
Do your best!

00:00:56.848 --> 00:00:58.808
It's so cold. I can't take it.

00:00:58.808 --> 00:01:01.144
Hey, help me!

00:01:01.144 --> 00:01:02.687
I can't. It's too cold!

00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:04.439
Hey, Yukiho!

00:01:14.032 --> 00:01:15.033
Snow...

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:20.080
Maybe this is a sign...

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:26.252
saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:33.843
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:01:40.892 --> 00:01:46.272
Tsuyoi tsuyoi negaigoto ga
A strong, strong wish

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:51.778
bokutachi wo michibiite kureta
Led us along

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:56.866
tsugi wa zettai yuzurenaiyo
We can't give up the next one

00:01:56.866 --> 00:02:01.996
nokosareta jikan wo nigirishimete We'll hold
on tightly to the time we have remaining

00:02:01.996 --> 00:02:07.502
tada no omoide sore dake ja iyadayo
We don't want only a memory

00:02:07.502 --> 00:02:13.341
seiippai chikara no kagiri hashirunda
We'll run as hard as we can

00:02:13.341 --> 00:02:16.219
(CHANCE FOR ME CHANCE FOR YOU)
(Chance for me! Chance for you!)

00:02:16.219 --> 00:02:21.808
Saa yume wo dakishimetara ue wo muite
Come on... Embrace your dreams and look up

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:26.604
kimi no sekai ga ohkiku kawaruyo
Your world will change dramatically

00:02:26.604 --> 00:02:32.736
saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:02:32.736 --> 00:02:37.782
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:02:37.782 --> 00:02:43.121
Ima koko de deaeta kiseki
The miracle that we met here and now

00:02:43.121 --> 00:02:49.836
wasurenaide bokutachi no kisetsu
Don't forget our season

00:02:57.135 --> 00:02:58.428
Sis!

00:02:58.428 --> 00:03:00.638
#9 - Melody of the Heart
Alisa? Good morning.

00:03:00.638 --> 00:03:03.892
Don't give me that! Don't you need to go?

00:03:03.892 --> 00:03:06.811
Yukiho said Honoka-san and
the others have already left.

00:03:08.563 --> 00:03:12.859
They have to attend the
school orientation meeting.

00:03:13.318 --> 00:03:19.240
They're going to the school before
heading to the event, so it's fine.

00:03:21.826 --> 00:03:25.705
But, I didn't expect this much snow...

00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:27.290
This isn't good.

00:03:27.791 --> 00:03:28.625
Sis.

00:03:29.834 --> 00:03:31.044
Are you nervous?

00:03:31.044 --> 00:03:31.711
What?

00:03:33.004 --> 00:03:36.216
You have the face you make
before your ballet recitals...

00:03:38.968 --> 00:03:40.178
Do 1?

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:47.101
It's okay.

00:03:47.852 --> 00:03:49.813
Everyone's on your side!

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:51.981
Alisa...

00:03:51.981 --> 00:03:53.733
I'll go to support you!

00:03:54.609 --> 00:03:55.568
Thank you.

00:04:00.114 --> 00:04:00.949
Nozomi.

00:04:00.949 --> 00:04:02.200
Good morning.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.993
You're still not dressed?

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:08.915
I-I'll go get ready right away.

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:09.999
Eli-chi.

00:04:12.544 --> 00:04:15.046
Could it be...that you're nervous?

00:04:18.883 --> 00:04:20.426
I was until just now.

00:04:21.135 --> 00:04:22.554
It's so cold!

00:04:22.971 --> 00:04:26.140
Are we really putting on a concert like this?

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.059
It looks like it's going ahead as planned.

00:04:28.059 --> 00:04:29.435
What?

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:31.271
It's supposed to clear up this afternoon.

00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:32.856
It'll probably be fine.

00:04:32.856 --> 00:04:35.733
But the cold is difficult enough to deal with!

00:04:35.733 --> 00:04:36.818
Anyway, Rin-chan...

00:04:39.445 --> 00:04:40.405
Let's do our best.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:43.908
Of course!

00:04:45.743 --> 00:04:46.411
Thanks for waiting.

00:04:46.411 --> 00:04:47.787
You're late.

00:04:47.787 --> 00:04:51.124
That's why I said you
didn't have to wait for me.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:52.709
So cold!

00:04:52.709 --> 00:04:54.752
That's what you get for making us wait!

00:04:54.752 --> 00:04:57.672
Let go of me! I couldn't help it.

00:05:00.091 --> 00:05:01.301
What's wrong?

00:05:01.926 --> 00:05:04.554
My mom told me to take these for everyone...

00:05:06.055 --> 00:05:06.806
What are they?

00:05:09.142 --> 00:05:10.852
They're cutlet sandwiches!

00:05:10.852 --> 00:05:14.647
- Nico-Nico-Ni!
- Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:05:14.981 --> 00:05:16.566
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:05:18.234 --> 00:05:19.986
The real deal is something else!

00:05:19.986 --> 00:05:20.528
Yeah!

00:05:20.862 --> 00:05:23.740
Come on! Let's cheer for
our sister one more time!

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:24.490
Yeah!

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:25.825
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:05:25.992 --> 00:05:28.870
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:05:29.037 --> 00:05:30.580
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:31.789
Thanks!

00:05:31.789 --> 00:05:34.500
I promise we'll make it through
the final preliminaries!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:38.588
Yeah! After all, you're what makes J's, right?

00:05:38.588 --> 00:05:39.422
Huh?

00:05:39.422 --> 00:05:42.884
You may be working together now, but
as a super idol, you're the center, right?

00:05:42.884 --> 00:05:44.093
What? Um...

00:05:44.594 --> 00:05:46.763
O-Of course!

00:05:46.763 --> 00:05:49.140
Without me, there is no y's!

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:51.893
Cotaro!?

00:05:51.893 --> 00:05:53.311
Don't be so noisy!

00:05:54.729 --> 00:05:55.813
All done.

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:58.024
Huh?

00:06:02.111 --> 00:06:03.237
Is this...?

00:06:04.656 --> 00:06:06.032
M's.

00:06:13.456 --> 00:06:14.499
Thanks.

00:06:14.499 --> 00:06:15.917
You can do it.

00:06:15.917 --> 00:06:19.671
Yeah. Have Mom bring you to the event.

00:06:20.171 --> 00:06:23.132
I'll sing my heart out as the center.

00:06:24.342 --> 00:06:25.009
Really?

00:06:25.009 --> 00:06:29.681
Yeah. After all, everyone in J's is the center!

00:06:34.352 --> 00:06:36.312
Nico-cchi, good morning.

00:06:37.563 --> 00:06:39.649
What are you guys doing here?

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:45.446
Nozomi said she wanted all
three of us to go together.

00:06:45.446 --> 00:06:46.072
Why?

00:06:46.781 --> 00:06:49.575
It's not me. It's what the cards are telling me.

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:54.330
If the three of us don't go
together, we might regret it.

00:06:54.998 --> 00:06:56.457
Say what?

00:06:56.457 --> 00:06:57.750
She's not very straightforward.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:59.377
Neither are you, Eli.

00:07:02.505 --> 00:07:05.383
Gimme a minute. I'll get ready right away.

00:07:07.635 --> 00:07:10.847
It's cold. Why don't you come in?

00:07:13.057 --> 00:07:16.060
All these people came despite the weather!

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:16.853
Yeah!

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:21.232
It's so cold!

00:07:21.232 --> 00:07:23.943
I'm happy about the snow, but I hate the cold!

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:26.154
It's only natural for it to be cold when it snows.

00:07:27.071 --> 00:07:30.366
More importantly, we should
head to the auditorium.

00:07:30.366 --> 00:07:31.117
Yeah!

00:07:31.117 --> 00:07:31.826
You're right.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:36.456
We'll nail our greeting and
get pumped for the concert!

00:07:37.582 --> 00:07:38.166
What!?

00:07:38.499 --> 00:07:40.835
It's starting an hour later?

00:07:40.835 --> 00:07:43.880
It can't be helped, considering the conditions.

00:07:46.299 --> 00:07:47.550
I see.

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.052
I guess there's nothing we can do about it...

00:07:49.469 --> 00:07:53.765
The director said we could skip
the school orientation meeting,

00:07:54.557 --> 00:07:56.434
but we can't do that...

00:07:57.101 --> 00:07:58.144
I understand.

00:07:58.686 --> 00:08:02.440
I'll explain the situation,
and the six of us will rehearse.

00:08:03.149 --> 00:08:05.777
Let's head to the greenroom.

00:08:09.238 --> 00:08:10.281
Nico?

00:08:11.199 --> 00:08:15.536
Hello! Thank you for coming
despite the conditions outside.

00:08:15.536 --> 00:08:18.873
I'm sorry, but the orientation
has been delayed an hour.

00:08:21.375 --> 00:08:22.627
What now?

00:08:22.627 --> 00:08:27.090
Sorry. We just reached the venue.

00:08:31.427 --> 00:08:32.637
Amazing...

00:08:33.012 --> 00:08:36.182
This is the stage for the final preliminary...

00:08:36.182 --> 00:08:37.642
It's so big!

00:08:37.642 --> 00:08:39.894
O-Of course it is!

00:08:39.894 --> 00:08:42.438
It's the final preliminary for Love Live.

00:08:42.438 --> 00:08:43.815
What are you afraid of?

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:50.196
There's going to be a ton of people...

00:08:50.196 --> 00:08:52.657
We need all nine members...

00:08:52.657 --> 00:08:55.868
In any case, hurry over once you're finished.

00:08:55.868 --> 00:08:56.577
Okay.

00:08:57.328 --> 00:08:58.621
Sorry, sorry!

00:08:58.621 --> 00:09:00.540
We finished guiding the people who came.

00:09:01.415 --> 00:09:04.752
Now we just have to guide the latecomers.

00:09:05.711 --> 00:09:06.754
Yeah!

00:09:09.298 --> 00:09:11.217
Hey!

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:13.803
Honoka!?

00:09:13.803 --> 00:09:14.929
We're here to help!

00:09:14.929 --> 00:09:16.681
Where should we start?

00:09:16.681 --> 00:09:18.224
What are you talking about!?

00:09:18.641 --> 00:09:22.478
Yeah. What day do you think this is?

00:09:22.478 --> 00:09:24.564
It's the final preliminaries.

00:09:24.564 --> 00:09:25.940
Did you forget?

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:27.525
No, but...

00:09:27.525 --> 00:09:31.487
Then you shouldn't be
wasting your strength here.

00:09:31.487 --> 00:09:33.072
Go on!

00:09:33.072 --> 00:09:35.074
But we're the student council—

00:09:35.074 --> 00:09:37.034
- All the more reason for you to go!
- What?

00:09:37.034 --> 00:09:40.955
Besides, there's no way you can
shovel snow in those outfits.

00:09:40.955 --> 00:09:42.665
Are you trying to catch a cold?

00:09:46.419 --> 00:09:55.052
You're going to Love Live, and you're on the
student council for the school's sake, right?

00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:59.056
So it's our turn to save you.

00:09:59.056 --> 00:10:00.933
We want to help.

00:10:05.229 --> 00:10:06.772
And we're not the only ones.

00:10:07.315 --> 00:10:08.232
Everyone feels the same way.

00:10:13.237 --> 00:10:15.156
Leave this to us.

00:10:15.156 --> 00:10:21.120
Focus on your greeting and
the final preliminary, okay?

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:23.873
Everyone...

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:32.965
Wow! I can't believe we're
about to sing here...

00:10:32.965 --> 00:10:34.425
It's beautiful!

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:39.096
Is this place really going to fill
up in this kind of weather...?

00:10:39.096 --> 00:10:40.431
I'm sure it'll be fine.

00:10:40.431 --> 00:10:43.100
It'll be packed.

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:45.019
It'll be a full house.

00:10:45.436 --> 00:10:48.606
It will be the perfect stage
for our final preliminary.

00:10:48.606 --> 00:10:50.149
A-A-RISE!

00:10:50.149 --> 00:10:52.318
Don't. We're equals now.

00:10:52.318 --> 00:10:53.778
And rivals.

00:10:54.445 --> 00:10:55.071
Yeah...

00:10:55.071 --> 00:10:58.157
It seems you're not all here...

00:10:58.908 --> 00:10:59.784
Yes.

00:10:59.784 --> 00:11:03.788
Honoka and her friends have business
at our school and will be coming later.

00:11:03.788 --> 00:11:05.748
But they'll make it in time
for our performance.

00:11:06.832 --> 00:11:07.667
I see...

00:11:08.584 --> 00:11:10.753
Then relay my message to them, too.

00:11:12.046 --> 00:11:15.258
Today's concert will determine our fates.

00:11:15.716 --> 00:11:17.551
Let's do our best.

00:11:18.594 --> 00:11:19.220
However...

00:11:20.513 --> 00:11:22.056
...we will not lose.

00:11:30.398 --> 00:11:32.108
Honoka-chan...

00:11:32.108 --> 00:11:34.819
Director, thank you very much.

00:11:35.236 --> 00:11:39.740
Next is a greeting from the student council
president representing the students.

00:11:44.412 --> 00:11:46.247
Hello, everyone.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:49.834
I am the student council president...

00:11:53.838 --> 00:11:55.548
...Kosaka Honoka.

00:11:57.258 --> 00:11:58.676
Love Live!

00:12:01.595 --> 00:12:03.639
The snow isn't stopping.

00:12:04.473 --> 00:12:06.517
The weather report said it would clear up...

00:12:06.517 --> 00:12:08.436
So, where are Honoka and the others?

00:12:08.436 --> 00:12:10.479
What? You can't travel!?

00:12:10.479 --> 00:12:13.733
That's right. The trains have stopped...

00:12:13.733 --> 00:12:15.985
But...will you make it in time?

00:12:15.985 --> 00:12:19.822
We're asking Honoka-chan's dad
to pick us up in his car...

00:12:19.822 --> 00:12:22.116
He can't! The traffic's not moving, either!

00:12:22.116 --> 00:12:24.535
What? Then all of our
transportation options are...

00:12:28.039 --> 00:12:29.332
They can't come?

00:12:35.338 --> 00:12:36.922
We'll have to run.

00:12:37.757 --> 00:12:38.466
Honoka-chan!?

00:12:38.841 --> 00:12:41.093
We still have an hour before it starts.

00:12:41.093 --> 00:12:42.345
If we hurry, we can make it!

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:44.305
But outside...

00:12:47.641 --> 00:12:49.393
We don't have time to think.

00:12:57.151 --> 00:13:00.363
They shoveled the snow, but there's
already so much on the ground!

00:13:00.363 --> 00:13:03.157
And it's snowing even harder now!

00:13:03.157 --> 00:13:07.036
At this rate, even if we head there,
I'm not sure we'll make it.

00:13:09.705 --> 00:13:11.374
Let's go, Honoka-chan!

00:13:11.374 --> 00:13:12.291
Kotori-chan!

00:13:12.291 --> 00:13:15.336
If we give it everything we
have, it won't be scary!

00:13:15.336 --> 00:13:15.878
Let's go!

00:13:17.296 --> 00:13:19.924
We've worked hard for this day!

00:13:19.924 --> 00:13:20.716
We can do it!

00:13:23.094 --> 00:13:24.261
Kotori.

00:13:24.261 --> 00:13:25.012
Yeah!

00:13:25.638 --> 00:13:26.680
Everyone's waiting!

00:13:32.978 --> 00:13:33.979
Honoka!

00:13:36.982 --> 00:13:38.859
Whoal!

00:13:39.402 --> 00:13:40.820
Honoka-chan!

00:13:42.071 --> 00:13:42.988
It's cold!

00:13:45.825 --> 00:13:47.785
The snow is clinging to my legs!

00:14:35.875 --> 00:14:37.376
Don't give up!

00:14:39.253 --> 00:14:43.424
We... We worked really,
really hard to get here!

00:14:43.424 --> 00:14:45.593
I feel the same way!

00:14:45.593 --> 00:14:48.471
I'm not just chasing after you two!

00:14:48.471 --> 00:14:49.597
I want to do it!

00:14:50.556 --> 00:14:53.142
I want to make it to Love Live
more than anyone else!

00:14:54.643 --> 00:14:57.688
I want the nine of us to produce
the best possible results we can!

00:14:58.939 --> 00:15:00.065
Let's go!

00:15:02.818 --> 00:15:03.527
Yeah!

00:15:31.805 --> 00:15:33.182
What?

00:15:33.182 --> 00:15:33.974
What is this?

00:15:33.974 --> 00:15:35.309
You're late.

00:15:35.309 --> 00:15:36.268
Huh?

00:15:36.268 --> 00:15:38.187
The snow is already piling up again.

00:15:45.569 --> 00:15:49.240
Did you...do all of this?

00:15:53.077 --> 00:15:53.702
Here.

00:15:53.702 --> 00:15:55.329
They're snow boots.

00:15:55.329 --> 00:15:57.706
Don't mind the fact that they don't fit very well.

00:15:57.706 --> 00:15:59.375
Don't worry!

00:15:59.375 --> 00:16:02.920
We'll help you get to the event!

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:06.423
We heard the trains were stopped,
so we called everyone.

00:16:06.966 --> 00:16:09.927
We asked them to come for you.

00:16:10.886 --> 00:16:12.513
And they did.

00:16:12.513 --> 00:16:13.639
The entire school.

00:16:15.891 --> 00:16:16.976
There we go.

00:16:21.313 --> 00:16:22.481
Everyone...

00:16:24.149 --> 00:16:25.192
Now, run.

00:16:29.488 --> 00:16:32.116
The path created by
Otonokizaka High's students.

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:49.925
You're all... weird...

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:52.886
Doing all this work...

00:16:54.597 --> 00:16:55.723
There's...

00:16:58.225 --> 00:16:59.852
There's something really wrong with you!

00:17:01.103 --> 00:17:02.813
Go!

00:17:05.774 --> 00:17:08.402
Run as fast as you can!

00:17:08.402 --> 00:17:09.778
You can do it!

00:17:09.778 --> 00:17:11.363
Watch your step!

00:17:11.363 --> 00:17:12.615
You can make it!

00:17:12.615 --> 00:17:13.866
Don't panic!

00:17:13.866 --> 00:17:15.618
Over here!

00:17:17.161 --> 00:17:18.329
Straight ahead!

00:17:21.373 --> 00:17:23.334
You can do it!

00:17:23.876 --> 00:17:25.586
Run!

00:17:26.045 --> 00:17:26.962
Don't trip!

00:17:28.005 --> 00:17:30.174
Left ahead!

00:17:30.174 --> 00:17:31.634
Hey!

00:17:31.634 --> 00:17:33.427
This way!

00:17:33.427 --> 00:17:34.928
You're almost there!

00:17:34.928 --> 00:17:35.846
Looking good!

00:18:00.913 --> 00:18:02.748
Honoka-chan!

00:18:02.748 --> 00:18:03.916
They made it!

00:18:03.916 --> 00:18:04.875
I'm so glad!

00:18:05.626 --> 00:18:06.710
Girls!

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:08.879
Honoka!

00:18:08.879 --> 00:18:12.341
Eli-chan!

00:18:22.476 --> 00:18:23.227
Girls!

00:18:27.398 --> 00:18:30.234
It was cold! And scary!

00:18:30.234 --> 00:18:34.279
I didn't want it to end here!

00:18:34.279 --> 00:18:37.324
This is our last chance to
accomplish something together.

00:18:37.324 --> 00:18:42.037
It'd be sad if we don't accomplish
anything after how hard we've worked!

00:18:42.037 --> 00:18:43.122
So...

00:18:47.918 --> 00:18:48.877
Thank you.

00:18:50.587 --> 00:18:53.465
Sheesh! Should you be crying right now?

00:18:53.465 --> 00:18:55.259
You're tearing up, too.

00:18:55.259 --> 00:18:56.385
I'm not crying.

00:18:57.678 --> 00:18:58.637
You're the one crying.

00:19:01.181 --> 00:19:02.141
Sheesh.

00:19:04.143 --> 00:19:05.018
Everyone...

00:19:06.937 --> 00:19:08.856
We should thank them.

00:19:09.565 --> 00:19:10.482
Yeah.

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:14.945
Thank you, everyone.

00:19:14.945 --> 00:19:17.489
We'll sing our hearts out!

00:19:18.031 --> 00:19:20.325
With the feelings we have now!

00:19:20.868 --> 00:19:23.829
The way we love, how we love.

00:19:23.829 --> 00:19:25.372
We'll sing out our love!

00:19:25.914 --> 00:19:29.209
We'll make this concert a success!

00:19:32.755 --> 00:19:34.173
Looks like they made it.

00:19:44.475 --> 00:19:45.601
You can do it!

00:19:45.601 --> 00:19:46.435
Go!

00:19:46.435 --> 00:19:47.227
Fight!

00:19:47.227 --> 00:19:48.645
M's!

00:19:48.645 --> 00:19:49.646
Sis!

00:19:49.646 --> 00:19:51.106
Honoka!

00:19:51.106 --> 00:19:52.941
- Kotori-chan!
- Umi!

00:19:52.941 --> 00:19:53.734
Hanayo!

00:19:53.734 --> 00:19:55.235
- Rin-chan!
- Nozomi!

00:19:55.235 --> 00:19:55.778
Eli!

00:19:55.778 --> 00:19:57.613
- Maki-chan!
- Nico-Ni!

00:19:57.613 --> 00:19:58.947
Hello, everyone!

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:05.204
We're going to be singing a new
song we wrote just for this day.

00:20:05.746 --> 00:20:08.707
We took all of our gratitude
and put it into a song.

00:20:09.374 --> 00:20:17.341
Thanks to all the people who helped and
supported us, we are standing here now.

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:22.221
This is a song we all wrote together!

00:20:24.139 --> 00:20:24.890
Please listen.

00:20:28.811 --> 00:20:30.437
I love school.

00:20:31.522 --> 00:20:33.357
I love music.

00:20:34.483 --> 00:20:36.318
I love idols.

00:20:37.361 --> 00:20:39.279
I love dancing.

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:42.241
I love our members.

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:45.202
I love each day.

00:20:46.245 --> 00:20:48.163
I love working hard.

00:20:48.831 --> 00:20:51.124
I love singing.

00:20:51.834 --> 00:20:54.586
Because I loved u's...

